The
\emph{stable Fukaya category}
of the Liouville manifold $\Uv$
is defined
as the quotient
\begin{align}
  \sfuk{\Uv} \coloneqq \wfuk{\Uv} / \fuk{\Uv}
\end{align}
of the wrapped Fukaya category $\wfuk{\Uv}$
by its full subcategory $\fuk{\Uv}$
consisting of compact Lagrangian submanifolds.

