for the latter)
and the same conclusion.

The \emph{transpose} of $\bfw$ is defined in \cite{MR1214325} as
\begin{align}
 \bfwv =  \sum_{i=1}^n \prod_{j=1}^n x_j^{a_{ji}},
\end{align}
whose exponent matrix $\Av$
is the transpose matrix of $A$.

